{"ID":"20240206100012-oss2jpr","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"false","id":"20240206100012-oss2jpr","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100012-oss2jpr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100020-s5pqom9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617100409-e5mmnjt\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1720,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620141657-6qp3fj9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:6,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:6\u0026#125;","title":"095槐实","type":"doc","updated":"20240809081355"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100020-s5pqom9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100020-s5pqom9","updated":"20240206100024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于天津市、北京市、河南省、山东省、江苏省、安徽省、陕西省、河北省等地。\n【性状】\t连珠状。表面黄绿色或黄棕色，皱缩而粗糙，背缝线一侧呈黄色。质柔润、干燥，易在收缩处折断，断面黄绿色，有粘性。种子1-6粒，肾形，表面光滑，棕黑色，一侧有灰白色圆形种脐；质坚硬，子叶2，黄绿色。果肉气微，味苦，种子嚼之有豆腥气。\n【性味】\t苦，寒。\n【功效】\t清热泻火、凉血止血功能。用于肠热便血，痔肿出血，肝热头痛，眩晕目赤。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100015-bmhbjqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100015-bmhbjqe","updated":"20240206100015"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100015-px0admp.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240620141657-6qp3fj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620141657-6qp3fj9","updated":"20240715145120"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240620141657-ttz9dei.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902094052-yk1ncs6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902094052-yk1ncs6","updated":"20240902094052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 362px;","style":"width: 352px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 1-20240715144631-ymc9lyl.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 352px;\" parent-style=\"width: 362px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 850px;","style":"width: 840px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 2-20240715145006-3z1s1mp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 840px;\" parent-style=\"width: 850px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902094052-lryjgem","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902094052-lryjgem","updated":"20240902094052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 377px;","style":"width: 367px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 13-20240715150347-elkep1z.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 367px;\" parent-style=\"width: 377px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 835px;","style":"width: 825px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 12-20240715150244-crmzh3k.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 825px;\" parent-style=\"width: 835px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240902094052-gufjnkb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902094052-gufjnkb","updated":"20240902094052"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 391px;","style":"width: 381px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 3-20240715145116-ef5kqri.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 381px;\" parent-style=\"width: 391px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 821px;","style":"width: 811px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 4-20240715145335-uvlp67b.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 811px;\" parent-style=\"width: 821px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620141423-3l53u1c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620141423-3l53u1c","updated":"20240809081322"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐实"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐实-20240620141423-252fyn6.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 589px;","style":"width: 579px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 5-20240715145505-94irx4n.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 579px;\" parent-style=\"width: 589px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715145602-ldmk19c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715145602-ldmk19c","updated":"20240715145751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 614px;","style":"width: 604px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 6-20240715145602-0jq4ri9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 604px;\" parent-style=\"width: 614px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 613px;","style":"width: 603px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 7-20240715145751-w1t3nbt.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 603px;\" parent-style=\"width: 613px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715145935-pz2xdzg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715145935-pz2xdzg","updated":"20240809081341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 9-20240715145935-apsy0t5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 10-20240715150032-12r4dkc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715150451-wcb12kb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715150451-wcb12kb","updated":"20240809081355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 526px;","style":"width: 516px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐花"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐花-20240619171435-t5dozcy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 516px;\" parent-style=\"width: 526px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 525px;","style":"width: 515px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐花2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐花2-20240619171502-zab28cw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 515px;\" parent-style=\"width: 525px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240715144608-s2pmyvj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715144608-s2pmyvj","updated":"20240715145837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 497px;","style":"width: 487px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树-20240715144608-i8w3dc1.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 487px;\" parent-style=\"width: 497px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 558px;","style":"width: 548px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"槐树 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/槐树 8-20240715145837-a095xs2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 548px;\" parent-style=\"width: 558px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240607140658-w3btla0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607140658-w3btla0"}},{"ID":"20240607140759-g56emeu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607140759-g56emeu","updated":"20240607140759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607140759-5s4kcp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140759-5s4kcp9","updated":"20240607140759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140759-q7y48zk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140759-q7y48zk","updated":"20240607140759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，五痔，火创，妇人乳瘕，子藏急痛。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140759-ziyzqwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140759-ziyzqwp","updated":"20240607140759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生河南。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140759-oirbl8a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140759-oirbl8a","updated":"20240607140759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《说文》云：槐木也；《尔雅》云：欀，槐大叶而黑。郭璞云：槐树叶大色黑者，名为欀，又守宫槐叶，昼聂宵炕；郭璞云：槐叶昼日聂合，而夜炕布者，名为守宫槐。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140624-h9weg7i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607140624-h9weg7i"}},{"ID":"20240607140712-md3h133","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607140712-md3h133","updated":"20240607140716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240607140712-4lse0ju","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140712-4lse0ju","updated":"20240607140712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸、咸，寒，无毒。主治五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，治五痔。火疮，妇人乳瘕，子脏急痛。以七月七日取之，捣取汁，铜器盛之，日煎，令可作丸，大如鼠屎，内窍中，三易乃愈。又堕胎。久服明目，益气，头不白，延年。枝主洗疮及阴囊下湿痒。皮主烂疮。根主喉痹寒热。生河南平泽。可作神烛。（景天为之使。）"}]},{"ID":"20240607140712-r7khy1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140712-r7khy1n","updated":"20240617100722"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐子以多连者为好，十月上巳日采之。新盆盛，合泥百日，皮烂为水，核如大豆。服之，今令人脑满，发不白而长生。今处处有，此云七月取其子未坚，故捣绞取汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100716-of8lll6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100716-of8lll6"}},{"ID":"20240617100718-ml1t4li","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100718-ml1t4li","updated":"20240617100727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100718-cvykx3q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100718-cvykx3q","updated":"20240617100718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸、咸，无毒．以七月七日取之，捣取汁，铜器盛之，日煎，令可作丸，大如鼠矢内窍中，三易乃愈．又堕胎．久服明目、益气、头不白延年．枝，主洗疮及阴囊下湿痒．主烂疮．根，主喉痹寒热．生河南．可作神烛．（景天为之使．）"}]},{"ID":"20240617100718-yjmzxe2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100718-yjmzxe2","updated":"20240617100718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又，八月断槐大枝，使生嫩孽，煮汁酿酒，治大风痿痹甚效．"}]},{"ID":"20240617100718-ui6nwfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100718-ui6nwfj","updated":"20240617100731"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶槐实，味苦，寒．主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，五痔火创，妇人乳瘕，子藏急痛。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100737-b8av8h2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100737-b8av8h2"}},{"ID":"20240617100738-dx0eptg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100738-dx0eptg","updated":"20240617100744"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100738-3eiapig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100738-3eiapig","updated":"20240617100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"即槐角．泻风热、清肝、凉大肠．"}]},{"ID":"20240617100738-1l8ro6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100738-1l8ro6j","updated":"20240617100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒．清肝胆．凉大肠．疏风热．治烦闷风眩．痔血肠风．（粪前有血、名外痔；粪后有血、名内痔；谷道有肉、名举痔；头上有孔、名痔 ；疮内有虫、名虫痔；大法用槐角地榆生地人参凉血生血、防风秦艽祛风湿、归芎和血、黄芩枳壳宽肠、升麻升提、治肠风略同、不宜专用寒凉、须兼补剂收功．）阴疮湿痒．明目去泪．（清肝、泪为肝热．）固齿乌髭．（槐乃虚星之精、十月上巳采、渍牛胆中阴干百日、食后吞一枚、发白还黑、肠风痔血、尤宜服之．）杀虫堕胎．槐性纯阴．虚寒者宜戒．即虚热而非实火．亦勿妄投．去单子及五子者．铜槌捶碎．牛乳拌蒸．"}]},{"ID":"20240617100738-852o0q6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100738-852o0q6","updated":"20240617100738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐花（泻热凉血．）苦凉．功同槐实．凉血．治风热目赤．赤白泄痢．五痔肠风．吐崩便衄诸血．（舌上出血如线者、名舌衄，炒研掺之．）忌同槐实．含蕊而陈久者佳．微炒．"}]},{"ID":"20240607140717-5sbpa5u","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607140717-5sbpa5u"}},{"ID":"20240607140724-cqcptya","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607140724-cqcptya","updated":"20240607140727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607140724-dgxfjt2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140724-dgxfjt2","updated":"20240607140724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸、咸、寒，无毒。主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，疗五痔，火疮，妇人乳瘕，子之，捣取汁，铜器盛之，日煎，令可作丸，大如鼠矢，内窍中，三易乃愈。又堕胎，久服明目，益气，头不白，延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140724-lynpkv9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140724-lynpkv9","updated":"20240607140724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枝主洗疮及阴囊下湿痒。皮主烂疮。根主喉痹寒热。生河南平泽。可作神烛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140724-cpwkib4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140724-cpwkib4","updated":"20240607140724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"景天为之使。槐子以多连者为好，十月上巳日采之，新盆盛，合泥百日，皮烂为水，核如大豆。服之，今令人脑满，发不白而长生。今处处有，此云七月取其子未坚，故捣绞取汁。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140724-zl513s6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140724-zl513s6","updated":"20240607140724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕《别录》云∶八月断槐大枝，使生嫩孽，煮汁酿酒，疗大风痿痹甚效。槐耳味苦、辛，平，无毒。主五痔心痛，女人阴中痒痛。槐树菌也，当取坚如桑耳者。枝炮熨止蝎毒也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100444-crdk2au","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100444-crdk2au"}},{"ID":"20240617100445-230ptcy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100445-230ptcy","updated":"20240617100449"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100445-dy6imw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100445-dy6imw4","updated":"20240617100445"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实只言实，今当分为二。实本出夹中，若捣夹作煎者，当言夹也。夹中子，大如豆，坚而紫色者，实也。今本条不析出夹与夹中子，盖其用各别，皆疏导风热。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100558-45zfxtl","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100558-45zfxtl"}},{"ID":"20240617100559-n8l2k4m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-n8l2k4m","updated":"20240617100605"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-qp9wou6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-qp9wou6","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸、咸，寒，无毒。主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，五痔，火疮，妇人乳瘕子脏急痛。以七月七日取之，捣取汁，铜器盛之，日煎令可作丸，大如鼠屎，内窍中，三易乃愈。又堕胎。久服明目，益气，头不白，延年。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-lxlcucu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-lxlcucu","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主洗疮，及阴囊下湿痒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-ukbvmvg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-ukbvmvg","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"皮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主烂疮。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-5l56tvd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-5l56tvd","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主喉痹，寒热。生河南平泽。可作神烛。（景天为之使。）"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-5zkrmap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-5zkrmap","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶槐子，以相连多者为好，十月巳日采之。新盆盛，合泥百日，皮烂为水，核如大豆。服之令脑满，发不白而长生。今处处有。此云七月取其子，未坚，故捣绞取汁。唐本注云∶《别录》云，八月断槐大枝，使生嫩孽，煮汁酿酒，疗大风痿痹，甚效。槐耳，味苦、辛，平，无毒。主五痔，心痛，妇人阴中疮痛。槐树 也，当取坚如桑耳者。枝，炮熨止蝎毒。臣禹锡等谨按尔雅云∶ ，槐大叶而黑。守宫槐，叶昼聂，宵炕。释曰∶ ，槐一也。大叶而黑名 ，不尔即名槐。又曰∶槐叶昼合夜开者，别名守宫槐。聂，合也。炕，张也。药性论云∶槐子，臣，主治大热，难产。皮煮汁，淋阴囊坠肿气痛。又云槐白皮，味苦，无毒。能主治口齿风疳 血。以煎浆水煮含之。又煎淋浴男子阴疝卵肿。陈藏器云∶槐实本功外，杀虫去风。合房折取阴干煮服，味一如茶，明目，除热泪，头脑、心胸间热风烦闷，风眩欲倒，心头吐涎如醉，漾漾如船车上者。花堪染黄，子上房七月收之，染皂木为灰，长毛发。日华子云∶槐子，治丈夫、女人阴疮湿痒，催生。吞七粒。又云槐皮草，治中风皮肤不仁，喉痹，浸洗五痔并一切恶疮，妇人产门痒痛及汤火疮。煎膏，止痛长肉，消痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-bndlnkg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-bndlnkg","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶槐实，生河南平泽，今处处有之。其木有极高硕者。谨按《尔雅》槐有数种，叶大而黑者名 ，槐昼合夜开者名守宫槐，叶细而青绿者，但谓之槐，其功用不言有别。四月、五月开花，六月、七月结实，七月七日采嫩实，捣取汁作煎，十月采老实入药。皮、根采无时。今医家用槐者最多。春采嫩枝， 为黑灰以揩齿去 。烧青枝取沥以涂癣。取花之陈久者，筛末饮服以治下血。折取嫩房角作汤以当茗。主头风，明目，补脑。煮白皮汁以治口齿及下血，水吞黑子以变白发。木上耳，取末服方寸匕，治大便血及五痔，脱肛等。皆常用有殊效者。葛洪着扁鹊明目使发不落方∶十月上巳日，取槐子去皮，内新罂中，封口三七日。初服一枚，再二枚，至十日十枚，还从一枚始，大良。刘禹锡《传信方》着硖州王及郎中槐汤灸痔法∶以槐枝浓煎汤，先洗痔，便以艾灸其上七壮，以知为度。及早充西川安抚使判官，乘骡入骆谷，及宿有痔疾，因此大作，其状如胡瓜，贯于肠头热如 灰火，至驿僵仆。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-ndjgny4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-ndjgny4","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主邮吏云∶此病某曾患来，须灸即瘥。及命所使作槐汤洗热瓜上，令用艾灸至三、五壮，忽觉一道热气入肠中，因大转泻，先血后秽，一时至痛楚，泻后遂失胡瓜所在，登骡而驰。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-khak48m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-khak48m","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡采得后，去单子并五子者，只取两子、三子者。凡使，用铜锤捶之令破，用乌牛乳浸一宿，蒸过用。食疗主邪气，难产，绝伤。春初嫩叶亦可食。主瘾疹，牙齿，诸风疼。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-7ttw2r1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-7ttw2r1","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"外台秘要疗蛔虫心痛。取槐树上木耳，烧灰末如枣许，正发和水服，若不止，饮热水一升，蛔虫出。千金方疗胎赤眼。取槐木枝如马鞭大，长二尺，作二段，齐头麻油一匙置铜钵中，旦使童子一人以其木研之至瞑止，令仰卧，以涂向眼 ，日三度，瘥。又方疗痔。七月七日采槐子，熟捣绞取汁，内铜器中盛，宅中高门上曝之二十日以上，煎成取鼠粪大，纳谷道中，日三。亦主 ，百种疮。又方古方，明目，黑发。槐子于牛胆中渍，阴干百日，食后吞一枚，十日身轻，三十日白发黑，百日内通神。又方治九种心痛。当太岁上，取新生槐枝一握，去两头，水三大升，煮取一升，顿服。又方治鼻气窒塞。以水五升煮槐叶，取三升，下葱、豉调和再煎饮。千金翼治蠼 疮。槐白皮醋浸半日，洗之，及诸恶疮。肘后方治内 。用槐白皮捣丸，绵裹纳下部中，得效。又方疗肠痔，每大便常下血。槐树上木耳取末，饮服方寸匕，日三服。百一方治中风，身直不得屈伸反复者。取槐皮黄白者切之，以酒或水六升，煮取二升，去滓，适寒温，稍稍服之。经验方治野鸡痔。用槐、柳枝煎汤洗痔上，便以艾灸之七壮。又方治下血。槐花、荆芥穗等分为末，酒调下一钱匕。梅师方治崩中或赤白，不问年月远近。取槐枝烧灰，食前酒下方寸匕。又方治痔有虫咬谷道痒，或下脓血多。取槐白皮浓煮汁，安盆坐汤之虚其谷道，令更暖，良久欲大便，当虫出，不过三度即愈。如用末，绵裹纳下部。食医心镜治野鸡痔下血、肠风，明目方∶嫩槐叶一斤，蒸如造炙法，取叶碾作末，如茶法煎呷之。广利方治妊娠难产令易方∶水吞槐子七枚，即出。广济方疗牙齿疼痛。取槐树白皮一握切，以酪一升煮，去滓，用盐少许，适寒温含之，日三易之。必效方疗阴疮及湿痒。槐树北面不见日处一大握，水二升，煮取一升洗之三、五遍，冷复暖，若涉远恐冲风，即以米粉粉之，即效。张文仲疗肠痔方∶槐树上耳捣末，米饮服方寸匕，日三。又槐白皮一担，锉，以水煮令浓，脱衣入水中坐，冷更易，不过三用，虫出止。伤寒类要大热心闷者。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-bloe6ki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-bloe6ki","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐子烧末，酒服方寸匕。子母秘录∶日月未足而欲产者。槐树东枝，令孕妇手把，即易产。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-nv8mo4s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-nv8mo4s","updated":"20240617100559"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产宝疗崩中不止，不间年月远近方∶槐耳烧作灰为末，以酒服方寸匕。太清草木方槐者，虚星之精，以十月上巳日采子服之。去百病，长生通神。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100559-c5nkln3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100559-c5nkln3","updated":"20240617100622"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶槐实，只言实，今当分为二。实本出荚中，若捣荚作煎者，当言荚也。荚中子，大如豆，坚而紫色者，实也。今本条不析出夹与夹中子，盖其用各别，皆疏导风热。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100634-9vt96gc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100634-9vt96gc"}},{"ID":"20240617100635-nzzp5wt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100635-nzzp5wt","updated":"20240617100639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《药性切用》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100635-1lojvsn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100635-1lojvsn","updated":"20240617100635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即槐角。性味苦寒，入大肠而兼入肝胆。凉血宽肠，为肠风血痔专药。人乳拌蒸用。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100635-ecneo78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100635-ecneo78","updated":"20240617100635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花蕊∶即槐米；性稍轻扬，功近槐角，兼能治上。槐花∶性发扬，尤能凉血除风，为风热赤、下痢诸血专药，炒研用。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100644-zbakxqp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100644-zbakxqp"}},{"ID":"20240617100644-8pwbzcp","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100644-8pwbzcp","updated":"20240617100649"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100644-z8e3h7g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100644-z8e3h7g","updated":"20240617100644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。主五内邪气热，清浮游不归之根火。止涎唾，清肺经湿火。补绝伤，阳明主机关，此能滋养阳明也。五痔火疮，妇人乳瘕，皆阳明燥金之疾。子脏急痛。亦阳明经脉之病。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100644-cx96wmh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100644-cx96wmh","updated":"20240617100644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐当秋而实，得金之令。色黄，得金之色，故其性体清肃，乃手太阴、手阳明之要药也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100644-pvlcma5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100644-pvlcma5","updated":"20240617100644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"金衰则为火所侮，凡有余之火，不能归藏其宅，必犯肺与大肠，得此清肃之气以助之，则火而火自退。此从本之治，医之良法也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100703-ai45sgf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100703-ai45sgf"}},{"ID":"20240617100704-j8v82os","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100704-j8v82os","updated":"20240617100709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100704-5h2dwes","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100704-5h2dwes","updated":"20240617100704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦酸咸，寒，无毒。主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，五痔火疮，妇人乳瘕，子脏急痛。以七月七日取之，捣取汁，铜器盛之，日煎，令可作圆，大如鼠屎，内窍中，三易乃愈，又堕胎。久服明目，益气，头不白，延年。枝∶主洗疮及阴囊下湿痒；皮∶主烂疮；根∶主喉痹寒热。生河南平泽，可作神烛。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100654-htacw5i","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100654-htacw5i"}},{"ID":"20240617100655-e7ofmai","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100655-e7ofmai","updated":"20240617100659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《汤液本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100655-ic3au97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100655-ic3au97","updated":"20240617100655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、酸、咸，寒。无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100655-21ay77u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100655-21ay77u","updated":"20240617100655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《珍》云∶与桃仁治证同。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100655-cruj2n9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100655-cruj2n9","updated":"20240617100655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性论》云∶臣。治大热难产。皮煮汁，淋阴囊坠肿，气瘤。又，槐白皮，治口齿风疳。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100655-o3aoig9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100655-o3aoig9","updated":"20240617100655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《日华子》云∶槐子，治丈夫、女人阴疮湿痒；催生，吞七粒。皮，治中风皮肤不仁，喉痹；洗五痔，产门痒痛，及汤火疮。煎膏，止痛，长肉，消痈肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100655-smgbq8t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100655-smgbq8t","updated":"20240617100655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《别录》云∶八月断槐大枝使生嫩 ，煮汁酿酒，疗大风痿痹甚妙。槐耳，主五痔心痛，女使。槐花，味苦，无毒。治五痔心痛眼赤，杀腹脏虫及热。治皮肤风，肠风泻血，赤白痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100655-3xi6ys4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100655-3xi6ys4","updated":"20240617100655"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐胶，主一切风，化痰，治肝脏风，筋脉抽掣，急风口噤，四肢不收，顽痹或毒风，周身如虫行，或破伤风口眼偏斜，腰膝强硬。槐叶，平，无毒，煎汤，洗小儿惊疳壮热，疥癣疔疮，皮茎同用良。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100505-0x49ga9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100505-0x49ga9"}},{"ID":"20240617100506-f94x03o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100506-f94x03o","updated":"20240617100512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100506-itma47l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100506-itma47l","updated":"20240617100506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"即槐角"}]},{"ID":"20240617100506-0wwnma8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100506-0wwnma8","updated":"20240617100506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"泻风热，凉大肠"}]},{"ID":"20240617100506-6jdqbvz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100506-6jdqbvz","updated":"20240617100506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒纯阴。入肝经气分。疏风热，润肝燥，凉大肠。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100506-yrlhybk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100506-yrlhybk","updated":"20240617100506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治烦闷风眩，痔血肠风（粪前有血名外痔，粪后有血名内痔，谷道 肉名举痔，头上有孔名痔 ，疮内有虫名虫痔。大法用槐角、地榆、生地以凉血，芩、连、栀、柏以清热。防风、秦艽以祛风湿，芎、归、人参以和血生血，枳壳以宽肠，升麻以升提。治肠风略同，不宜专用寒凉，须兼补剂收功），阴疮湿痒，明目止泪（清肝，泪为肝热），固齿乌髭（十月上已采，渍牛胆中，阴干百日。食后吞一枚，明目补脑，发白还黑，肠风痔血，尤宜服之），杀虫（根、皮皆能洗痔）堕胎。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100506-8f7rtoy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100506-8f7rtoy","updated":"20240617100506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去单子及五子者，铜槌槌碎，牛乳拌蒸（槐乃虚星之精）。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100506-noworrc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100506-noworrc","updated":"20240617100506"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐花苦凉，入肝、大肠血分而凉血（血凉则阴自足）。治风热目赤，赤白泄痢，五痔肠风，吐崩诸血（舌上无故出血如线者，名血衄，炒研掺之）。陈者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100543-6nobrup","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100543-6nobrup"}},{"ID":"20240617100544-wb6joe2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100544-wb6joe2","updated":"20240617100548"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100544-gbrcbo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100544-gbrcbo1","updated":"20240617100544"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"即槐角，苦寒纯阴，清肝胆，凉大肠，泻风热。槐花苦凉，泻热凉血，功同槐实，陈者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100533-jjyjewh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100533-jjyjewh"}},{"ID":"20240617100534-q7ahjcj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100534-q7ahjcj","updated":"20240617100539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100534-te8kntd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100534-te8kntd","updated":"20240617100534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦寒。主五内邪气热。止涎唾。补绝伤。五痔火创。妇人乳瘕。子藏急痛。生平泽。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100534-ebchfcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100534-ebchfcn","updated":"20240617100534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"律移寒火。精散虚星。荚连珠缀。花袅金零。孟冬举烛。上巳推。参三取二。显证长龄。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100534-onj4xev","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100534-onj4xev","updated":"20240617100534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"周礼注。冬取槐檀之火。李峤诗。暮律移寒火。春秋说题辞。槐虚星之精。李时珍曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100534-h5xmhlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100534-h5xmhlo","updated":"20240617100534"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"其实作荚。如连珠。白居易诗。袅袅黄花枝。麻九畴诗。槐花满地黄金冷。梁书传。庾肩吾食槐实以十月上巳日采。名医曰。可作神烛。王泠然判对。既失推之典。雷论。凡采实。只取三子及两子者。庄子。勿参以三。左传。子犯曰。臣取二。梁武帝诗。显证表长龄。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100454-3x9ry4q","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100454-3x9ry4q"}},{"ID":"20240617100455-0b9umbd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100455-0b9umbd","updated":"20240617100459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100455-mr9qb88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100455-mr9qb88","updated":"20240617100455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦、辛、咸，气寒。无毒。折枝插地即活，人家多植门庭。实生荚中，十月收采。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100455-bxo8tw7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100455-bxo8tw7","updated":"20240617100455"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粒大如豆，色紫而坚。一荚两粒三粒者为良，若系单粒五粒者勿用。小铜锤击碎，乌牛乳浸宵。蒸过才煎，景天为使。主五内邪热，去五痔肿疼。（七月七日取，捣绞汁，贮铜器内，置高处曝二十日以上，煎稠硬，圆如鼠粪大，纳谷道内，三易之乃愈。）止涎唾，补绝伤，凉大肠，消乳瘕。除男子阴疮湿痒不歇，却女子产户痛痒难当。仍理火疮，且堕胎孕。酒吞七粒，催产尤良。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"嫩房荚"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"收煎代茶，去头风明目补脑。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"老荚"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疏导风热，亦可取捣煎尝。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"白皮"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"皮肤不仁服效。消阴疝卵肿，却壮热惊痫。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"茎叶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功同，总治疮毒。熬膏贴煮汁嗽口齿风疳。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"作神烛可烧，仍主喉痹寒热。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"枝"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"洗疮住痒， 揩齿杀虫。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"花"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去热。理肠风泻血及皮肤风，止痔 来红并赤白痢。去胃脘卒痛，杀腹脏蛔 。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"胶"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主诸风化涎，任作汤散丸服。却风痹肢难举动，散风毒身如虫行。噤口急风殊功，破脑伤风立效。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"槐耳"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"系菌，亦树所生。坚如桑耳者良，用作细末酒服。去妇人阴中疮痛，治痔谷道血流。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100338-z7payny","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100338-z7payny"}},{"ID":"20240607140734-6s1zc0y","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607140734-6s1zc0y","updated":"20240607140738"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240607140734-0f3wtyj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140734-0f3wtyj","updated":"20240607140734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实苦酸咸气寒，湿热肠风痔痢宽，疏五内邪清头目，疝痛阴疮胎产难，皮主牙疳根喉痹，枝治风痿崩带安。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140734-oxaqcun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140734-oxaqcun","updated":"20240607140734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐木，虚星之精，叶大则黑，昼合夜开，故从鬼。又名守宫实，即荚中子，大如豆，坚而色紫，俗名槐角。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140734-ongp073","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140734-ongp073","updated":"20240607140734"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒。主湿热肠风下痢、五痔，疏导五内邪气，风热烦闷。兼明目，除热泪，头脑风眩，心头吐涎如醉，漾漾如立舟车上者。又治疝痛及男妇阴疮湿痒，妇人乳瘕，子脏急痛，堕胎催生，吞七粒即效。本草云∶补绝伤益气，亦治中带补之剂也。微炒用。槐白皮，味苦。主口齿风疳 血，浆水煎含之。阴疝、卵肿、气瘤及痔有虫，或下脓血，煎汤淋洗槐根皮，平。主喉痹寒热，中风强直，皮肤不仁。煎汤洗五痔并一切恶疮，妇人产门痒痛及汤火疮。煎膏，消痈肿，止痛长肉。槐枝，煮汁酿酒疗大风、痿痹甚效。崩中，带下赤白，烧灰，酒调服。九种心痛，水煎服。又煎汤洗疮及阴囊下湿痒。 炭揩齿，去虫，烧沥涂癣，和麻油磨浓点赤眼。与槐叶平，煎汤，治小儿惊痫壮热，疥癣疔肿，鼻气窒塞。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140734-ry9njpr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607140734-ry9njpr"}},{"ID":"20240607140816-i03yg65","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607140816-i03yg65","updated":"20240607140822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240607140816-5y0yliv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140816-5y0yliv","updated":"20240607140816"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦酸咸，寒，无毒。主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，五痔，火疮，妇人乳瘕，子脏急痛，又堕胎。《药性论》云∶臣。治大热难产。皮∶煮汁，淋阴囊坠肿气痛。又槐白皮治口齿风疳。日华子云∶槐子治丈夫女人阴疮湿痒。催生，吞七粒。皮∶治中风，皮肤不仁，喉痹，洗五痔，产门痒痛及汤火疮。煎膏止痛，长肉，消痈肿。《别录》云∶八月断槐枝，使生嫩 ，煮汁酿酒，疗大风，痿痹，甚效。槐耳∶主五痔，心痛，妇人阴中疮痛。景天为之使。槐胶∶主一切风，化痰，治肝脏风，筋脉抽掣，急风口噤，四肢不收，顽痹，或毒风周身如虫行，或破伤风口眼偏斜，腰脊强硬。槐眼赤，杀腹脏虫及热，治皮肤风，肠风泻血，赤白痢疥癣，疔肿。皮茎同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100521-emr3xtn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100521-emr3xtn"}},{"ID":"20240617100522-4g7t5cn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100522-4g7t5cn","updated":"20240617100526"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100522-387eybk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100522-387eybk","updated":"20240617100522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感天地阴寒之气，兼木与水之化，故味苦、酸、咸，气寒，无毒。入手足阳明兼入足厥阴经。总苦寒纯阴之药，为凉血要品，能除一切热，散一切结，清一切火也。其花味以苦独胜，故除手足阳明、足厥阴之热尤效耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100522-h9u9gxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100522-h9u9gxs","updated":"20240617100522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实，去五内邪热，五痔肿痛、凉大肠，消乳瘕，男子阴湿燥痒不止，女人产户痛痒难当，理火疮，堕胎孕，酒吞七粒，催产犹奇。花味甚苦，炒黄凉大肠，去热理肠风，泻血及皮肤风热，止痔 来红，并白赤痢矣。去胃脘卒痛，杀腹脏蛔虫，但病患虚寒，脾胃作泻，及阴虚内热者忌服。枝主洗疮，及阴囊湿痒。皮主浴烂疮。根主喉痹寒热，叶煎汤，治小儿惊痫壮热疥癣及疔肿。外树上木耳，烧灰为末水服，善治虫咬心痛，并肠痔及便血俱神效。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100522-25wq5sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100522-25wq5sw","updated":"20240617100522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《大清草木方》云∶槐者虚星之精，以十月上已日采子，服之去百病，长生通神。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100522-x0x80ot","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100522-x0x80ot","updated":"20240617100522"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又（梁书）言∶庚肩吾常服槐实，年七十余发鬓皆黑，目看细字亦其验也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140817-7bq27pe","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607140817-7bq27pe"}},{"ID":"20240607140833-lej6jml","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607140833-lej6jml","updated":"20240607140840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240607140833-4otb9wk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140833-4otb9wk","updated":"20240607140833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒，无毒。主治五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，火疮，妇人乳瘕，子脏急痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140833-jsh5ddu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140833-jsh5ddu","updated":"20240607140833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（槐始出河南平泽，今处处有之。有数种，叶大而黑者，名 槐。昼合夜开者，名守宫。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140833-fkxujwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140833-fkxujwi","updated":"20240607140833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐叶细而青绿者，但谓之槐。槐之生也，季春五日而兔目，十日而鼠耳，更旬日而始规，再旬日而叶成，四五月间开黄花，六七月间结实作荚，连珠中有黑子，以子连多者为妙，其木材坚重，有青黄白黑色。《周礼》冬取槐檀之火。《淮南子》云∶老槐生火。《天元主物薄》云∶老槐生丹，槐之神异如此，其花未开时，炒过煎水，染黄甚鲜。陈藏器曰∶子上房，七月收之，可染皂，近时用槐花染绿。）"}]},{"ID":"20240607140833-11xjgcc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140833-11xjgcc","updated":"20240607140833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐生中原平泽，花黄子黑，气味苦寒，木质有青、黄、白、黑色，老则生火生丹，备五运之全精，故主治五内邪气之热，五脏在内，故曰五内。邪气热，因邪气而病热也。肺气不能四布其水精，则涎唾上涌，槐实能止之。肝血不能渗灌于经脉，则经脉绝伤，槐实能补之。心火内盛，则为火疮。脾土不和则为乳瘕。肾气内逆，则子脏急痛。槐禀五运之气，故治肺病之涎唾，肝病之绝伤，心病之火疮，脾病之乳瘕，肾病之急痛，而为五内邪气之热者如此。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100432-s2gjjlm","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100432-s2gjjlm"}},{"ID":"20240617100433-ov16y0m","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100433-ov16y0m","updated":"20240617100437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100433-7svljg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100433-7svljg7","updated":"20240617100433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"俗名槐角"}]},{"ID":"20240617100433-qf9jioo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100433-qf9jioo","updated":"20240617100433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦酸咸寒，无毒。取子入牛胆中，阴干，日服七枚，久服有明目通神，白发还黑之功。有痔及便血者尤宜服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100433-98gqcj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100433-98gqcj0","updated":"20240617100433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，五痔火疮，妇人乳瘕，子脏急痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100433-oq0atab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100433-oq0atab","updated":"20240617100433"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐者虚星之精，益肾清火，与黄 同类异治。盖黄 专滋肾经血燥，此则专滋肾家津枯。观《本经》主治，皆脾胃有热阴津不足之病，止涎唾。肾司闭藏之职也，下焦痔肠风，风热便血，年久不止者，用此一味熬膏炼蜜收服。妇人乳瘕、子脏急痛，皆肝家血热之患，用以清热滋燥，诸证自安。上皆指槐角而言。其角中核子专主明目，久服须发不白，益肾之功可知。惟胃虚少食及孕妇勿服。槐枝烧灰涂妒精疮，有清火润燥之功，《千金方》也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607140834-r8umt5x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607140834-r8umt5x"}},{"ID":"20240607140911-nkypbz4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607140911-nkypbz4","updated":"20240607140915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240607140911-pt4y4ra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607140911-pt4y4ra","updated":"20240607140911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦、寒。主五内邪气热，止涎唾，补绝伤，五痔，火疮。妇人乳瘕，子藏急痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100422-azipuo3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100422-azipuo3"}},{"ID":"20240617100423-u44ambq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-u44ambq","updated":"20240617100427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-abbvra7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-abbvra7","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【槐实】【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-cmosnb9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-cmosnb9","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦寒无毒．乃纯阴入肝经气分药也．"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-10q0nb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-10q0nb5","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-2bii75z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-2bii75z","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五内邪气热．止涎唾．补绝伤火疮．妇人乳瘕．子脏急痛．久服明目益气．头不白延年．治五痔疮 ．以七月七日取之．捣汁．铜器盛之．日煎令可丸如鼠屎纳窍中．日三易乃愈．又堕胎．治大热难产．杀虫去风．阴干煮饮．明目．除热泪头脑心胸间热．治丈夫女人阴疮湿痒．催生吞七粒．治口齿风．凉大肠．润肝燥．"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-8fi1j77","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-8fi1j77","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【槐花】【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-1sry91s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-1sry91s","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦平无毒．又曰味苦色黄气凉．入阳明厥阴血分药也．"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-0l4q9rc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-0l4q9rc","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240617100423-zeyol00","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100423-zeyol00","updated":"20240617100423"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五痔心痛眼赤．杀腹脏虫．及皮肤风热．肠风泻血赤白痢．并炒研服．凉大肠．炒香频嚼．治失音及喉痹．又疗吐血衄崩中漏下．"}]},{"ID":"20240607140911-n6dq4mn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607140911-n6dq4mn"}},{"ID":"20240617100353-jro44b6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-jro44b6","updated":"20240617100401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-8wtxgy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-8wtxgy7","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-jywqak2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-jywqak2","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实（按：亦称槐角）：苦、寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-h6bnhx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-h6bnhx7","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐花：苦、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-3r9v0zu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-3r9v0zu","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐叶：苦、平、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-abuemx0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-abuemx0","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-us93lk1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-us93lk1","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"木皮、根白皮："}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-ax91yol","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-ax91yol","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、中风身直，有能转动。用槐皮（黄白者）切细，加酒或水六升，煮成二升，分次服。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-9cgon0a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-9cgon0a","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、风虫牙痛。用槐树白皮一把，切细，加酪一升煮过，去渣，放一点盐，含漱。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-lqltw5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-lqltw5r","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、蠼螋恶疮。用槐白皮浸醋中半日后洗患处。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-d2yjpri","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-d2yjpri","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐叶："}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-dq6qkup","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-dq6qkup","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、肠风痔疾。用槐叶一斤，蒸熟晒干，研为末，煎饮代茶。久服还能明目。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-o7ixklb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-o7ixklb","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、鼻气窒塞。水煮槐叶，五升煮成三升，加入葱，豉调和，有煎饮。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-gg1o7ec","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-gg1o7ec","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐枝："}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-ho8cw1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-ho8cw1n","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、风热牙痛。用槐枝烧，烙痛处。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-rh3zix4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-rh3zix4","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、血崩、白带。用槐枝烧灰，每服一匙，饭前服，酒送下。一天服二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-u7u9sbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-u7u9sbe","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、阴疮湿痒。用槐枝煎水热洗。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-hwd1253","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-hwd1253","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐花："}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-9y1xpl6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-9y1xpl6","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、鼻血不止。用槐花、乌贼骨等分，半生半炒，研为末，吹入鼻内。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-himh96w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-himh96w","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、吐血不止。用槐花烧存性，加麝香少许，研匀，糯米汤送服三钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-141ig5c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-141ig5c","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、咯血、唾血。用槐花炒过、研细，每服三钱，糯米汤送下。服药后须静卧一、二小时。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-l8qy3u1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-l8qy3u1","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、尿血。用槐花（炒）、郁金（煨）各一两，共研为末。每服二钱，淡豉汤送下。立效。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-gtafilh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-gtafilh","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、屙血。用槐花、荆芥穗，等分为末，酒送服一匙。又方：用柏叶三钱，槐花六钱，每日煎汤服。又方：用槐花、枳壳等分，炒存性，研为末，水送服二钱。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-a77tul5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-a77tul5","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6、妇女漏血。用槐花烧存性。研为末。每服二、三钱，饭前服，温酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-b07me6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-b07me6m","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7、中风失音。炒槐花，三更后仰卧嚼咽。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-o1vtti3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-o1vtti3","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8、痈疽发背（凡中热毒，眼花头晕，口干舌甘，心惊背热，四肢麻木，觉有红晕在背部）。用槐花一堆，炒成褐色，泡好酒一碗中，乘热饮酒，汗出即愈，如未退，再炒一服。必愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-hd0ypw4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-hd0ypw4","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9、疔疮肿毒。用槐花微炒，核桃仁二两，放入酒一碗中煎开多次，热服。疮未成者二、三服，疮已成者一、二服，即可见效。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-z88hm5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-z88hm5l","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10、白带不止。用槐花（炒）、牡蛎（煅），等分为末。每服三钱，酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-kwcwbla","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-kwcwbla","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐实："}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-k96uoeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-k96uoeg","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、肠风泻血。用槐角（去梗，炒）一两，地榆、当归（酒焙）、防风、黄芩、枳壳（麸炒）各半两，共研为末，加酒、糊做成丸子，如梧子大。每服五十丸，米汤送下。此方名“槐角丸”。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-cexkrsv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-cexkrsv","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、大肠脱肛。用槐实、槐花等分，炒为末，蘸羊血炙熟吃（用猪肾去皮蘸末炙熟吃亦可），以酒关下。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-6eu47jv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-6eu47jv","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、内痔、外痔。用槐角一半，捣成汁，捣成汁，晒，浓，取地胆为末，同煎成丸，如梧子大。每服十丸，水送下。作丸时，也作成挺子，纳肛门内。地胆末可用苦参末代替。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-9ahpr5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-9ahpr5u","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、目热昏暗。用槐角、黄连各二两，共研为末，加蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服二十丸，浆水送下。每天二次。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100353-3zdm2bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100353-3zdm2bt","updated":"20240617100353"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、大热心闷。用槐角烧为末，酒送服一匙。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100354-eyp2qb1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100354-eyp2qb1"}},{"ID":"20240617100409-z5xga9e","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-z5xga9e","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-s2iytwb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-s2iytwb","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"处处有之。四五月开赭黄花。六七月结黑褐实。作荚如连珠。奇数者为贵。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-ickudl7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-ickudl7","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"实"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-pmb1qv0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-pmb1qv0","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（俗呼槐角）槐实当分为二。实本出荚中。若捣荚作煎者。当言荚。荚中子大如豆。坚而紫色者。为实。其用要皆疏导风热而已。（衍义）苦酸咸寒。气薄味浓。纯阴也。入足厥阴气分。兼入手足阳明经。主治润肝燥。疏导风热。久服益气明目。除热泪。头脑心胸间热风烦闷。风眩欲倒。心头吐涎如醉。漾漾如车船上者。并治口齿风。凉大肠。治五痔疮。苦寒纯阴。为凉血要品。折嫩房角。作汤代茗。主头风明目补脑。以子入冬月牛胆中渍之。阴干百日。每食后吞一枚。久之明目通神。白发返黑。有痔及下血者。尤宜服之。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-mvs7alf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-mvs7alf","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"花"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-jr3952u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-jr3952u","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味苦。色黄。气凉。手足阳明足厥阴血分药。主凉大肠。治肠风泻血。五痔便血血痢。并崩中漏下。又治胃脘卒痛。杀腹脏蛔虫。大肠下血。槐花荆芥穗等分。为末。酒服一钱匕。又方。柏叶三钱。槐花六钱。煎汤。日服。又方。槐花枳壳等分。炒存性。为末。新汲水服二钱。血崩不止。槐花三两。黄芩二两。为末。每服五钱。酒一碗。铜秤锤一枚。桑柴火烧红。浸入酒内。调服。忌口。下血血崩。槐花一两。棕灰五钱。盐一钱。水三钟。煎减半服。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-12q56h2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-12q56h2","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕疏风之剂多燥血。凉血之味未必能疏风。何以凉血疏风。槐花实兼擅其用。盖因气寒味苦。复有酸咸。苦咸应入血分。况导之以酸。而更合于寒。固是入肝凉血之剂。而好古乃以为肝经气分药。其义大可参也。周礼四时取火。冬取槐檀。淮南子云。老槐生火。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-1bm26g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-1bm26g9","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天元主物簿云。老槐生丹。然则花与实皆曰纯阴者。固纯乎阴之为用。以成其阳之能化也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-pn298eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-pn298eq","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以凉血热。即以疏导风热。风木出地。原乘阴以出而达乎阳者也。不然。槐实之用。何以上至极顶。而能补脑去头风明目乎。（别录所言益气良不谬）第此乃足厥阴正剂。何以凉大肠。曰。乙与庚合。是足厥阴之所首及者。试取凉血诸味相较。则此味不独乙庚相合。盖先有金木相媾之义焉。何则。诸阴不至于首。唯厥阴与督脉会于巅。以其阴中有阳也。督为阳气之元。肺为阳气之主。风淫为邪。乃阳之戾气也。如血凉而风静。是阴中真阳与天气合和。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-3vffg0u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-3vffg0u","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以补脑去头风明目也。既由木而上媾于金矣。肺大肠固为表里。其乙庚相合之用。不更为亲切乎。（有因风郁于胃以为大肠病者。以风升属乙木。其气郁于胃而不得达。则应归于大肠以为病。盖乙庚原相合。而足阳明胃与大肠更相上下也。风病则血病。风之郁者其本。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-r7i64g0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-r7i64g0","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"至血燥以为病者其标。此不宜纯用寒剂。以风升之气。即元气故耳。）夫肝血热甚则风生。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-1f77x70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-1f77x70","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"迸入肠胃。以此药对待之。可见其益统归阳明。而于乙庚之合尤切。盖阳明燥金也。燥者阴欲达而不即达也。风归肠胃。则益其燥。在大肠之主津者尤病。（凡风木不得上达。则其不能媾于金者。定反而刑土。以其无所归也。风病则血燥。血燥则随风而入肠胃以为病矣。在血热而化风者亦然。）甚而燥热合湿。致伤阴阳之络以病血溢。惟兹味由纯阴以凉血。乃能达其阴而燥平。燥平则阳得合阴以为用。而收令行矣。此肠风泻血所以奏功欤。故花之用在凉诸血。而下血尤有专功。实结于秋。似得金气而疏导风热为胜。以实之苦逊于花。而咸亦少逊。不能不稍为差等也。（如不少异。何以肠风黑散。花实并用。）抑花开于夏。何以凉血较胜。盖当至阳之化育。而得钟纯阴之性味。正与血之原于水而成于火者合也。且气味苦平。平亦辛也。统悉斯义。可以知其能矣。又用以凉血。而却为气分药者。阳出于阴中也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-qp3otwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-qp3otwg","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝为从阴达阳。乃阴气首出之脏。而司风木之化者。此树结实于六七月。时值土金递旺。能令肝脏血凉。且俾肝气得所养。所以久服而目明且益气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-pizwebf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-pizwebf","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"槐性苦寒。凡虚寒脾胃作泻。及阴虚血热而非实热者。外证虽同。却不宜服。（仲淳）〔修治〕槐实微炒用。槐花未开时采收。陈久者良。拣净。酒浸微炒。若以止血。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-73ogjts","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-73ogjts","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"须"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-5xvbaws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-5xvbaws","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"枝"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-7vsekk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-7vsekk4","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦平。洗疮及痔核并阴囊下湿痒。青枝烧沥。涂癣。黑。揩牙去虫。八月断大枝。候生嫩叶。煮汁酿酒。疗大风痿痹甚效。灸痔法。以槐枝浓煎汤。先洗痔。便以艾灸其上。七壮。以知为度。昔有患痔乘骡。其痔大剧。状如胡瓜。热气如火。至驿。僵仆。用此法灸至三五壮。忽觉热气一道入肠中。因大转泻。先血后秽。其痛甚楚。泻后。遂失胡瓜所在。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-q8tz25h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-q8tz25h","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胶"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-nk08woy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-nk08woy","updated":"20240617100409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味苦寒。治一切风。化涎。肝脏风筋脉抽掣。急风口噤。四肢不收顽痹。或毒风周身如虫行。或破伤风口眼偏斜。腰背强硬。汤散丸煎。或杂诸药。任用。"}]},{"ID":"20240617100409-e5mmnjt","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240617100409-e5mmnjt","updated":"20240617100409"}}]}